  "name": "Improve timeline view readability and layout",
  "description_html": "<p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"7f20e98b-f5a3-4206-b266-97d686ea69ef\">Experience improvement / design investigation, not a defect.<br><br>The timeline view is useful, but its present layout has weak visual hierarchy: the large code-like surface, line-number-like markers, and dense embedded items make it difficult to read as a timeline. Investigate the intended reading flow and propose a bounded redesign that makes chronology, grouping, and entries immediately legible without changing query/filter behavior.<br><br>Scope: date/group hierarchy, event ordering, embedded-item treatment, whitespace and density, metadata visibility, and empty/loading states. Use current screenshots and real notes as starting evidence.<br><br>Do not start product implementation until the design proposal has been reviewed.</p>",
